  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "P1 - the FIRST AiPrimitive in the corpus hosted as an HsmAction. Measured 2026-09-21: all 46 existing assets are BTreeAction/BTreeCondition, so the HSM hosting path had no golden at all. It exists to be driven from TWO parallel HSM regions bound to TWO different blackboard variables, so SeedParamsOffset (E3b-0) gives each occurrence a different seed and the two regions observe DIFFERENT params - the invariant BP-297 could never redden because HsmOrthogonalRegions\u0027 two regions both ran StubIdle, whose body is empty. The Main graph is deliberately trivial: what is under test is the SEED and the occurrence slot, not the graph body.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
